adaptation-samsung-gts7xlwifi (0.0.10) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Bluetooth: pin adapter Class of Device to Computer/Laptop (0x00010c) via
    etc/bluetooth/main.conf. Stock left the CoD as "Miscellaneous", so peer
    devices (phones) saw the tablet as an audio sink (music-note/headphone icon)
    and would not offer file transfer. The BT stack itself (adapter, pairing,
    A2DP audio) is fixed in the kernel (hci_sock.c un-gut + rfcomm/bnep/hidp
    Makefile subdirs) and needs no adaptation change. OBEX file-receive
    (bluez-obexd + an auto-accept session agent) remains a documented follow-up.

