adaptation-samsung-gts7xlwifi (0.0.9+git20260531152506.0000000.trixie) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Camera: fix the 90-degree clockwise preview rotation (both front + back).
    The camera HAL already delivers upright frames; droidian-camera's Qt
    VideoOutput.autoOrientation was adding a spurious 90deg on this
    landscape-native tablet. Ship:
    - usr/lib/droidian/device/droidian-camera.conf (primary config path, wins
      over /etc): backend=aal, autoorientation=false, orientation=0.
    - etc/apt/sources.list.d/mukahraman-droidian-camera.list + a preferences.d
      pin: pull the patched droidian-camera (mukahraman fork) that adds the
      orientation/autoorientation config keys the conf above relies on.

