adaptation-samsung-gts7xlwifi (0.0.8+git20260530192000.0000000.trixie) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Display: fix newly-launched apps not appearing until a screen lock/unlock. phoc on the
    hwcomposer backend (command-mode DSI panel) direct-scans-out a fullscreen surface and does
    not recomposite when a new window maps on top, leaving the screen stale until a forced
    repaint. Ship etc/environment.d/65-phoc-no-direct-scanout.conf setting
    WLR_SCENE_DISABLE_DIRECT_SCANOUT=1 so phoc always composites and new windows render
    immediately. Confirmed: apps now pop up right away.

